        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nemuyoowaala zisolo zyakwaabana nyika, muleelede kubika caabilo canyika cibe ca-Jehova, cibe cisi cisalalisya, Cileelede kuba abulamfu bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili ikumi. Cisi eci ciyoosalala koonse koonse buyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
