        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.42.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 42:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi akati kaco kuyooba busena buli azyooko zyone zyeelene; bulamfu buyooba tukokola tuli myanda yosanwe, abwaamba buyooba tukokola tuli myanda yosanwe, alimwi buyoozyuungulukwa lubuwa lwatukokola tuli makumi osanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela akati kacisi eci muyooeleka bulamfu bwazyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu abwaamba bwazyuulu zili ikumi. Mumweenya oyo mociyooba cikombelo, busena busalalisya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
