        {
          "text": "Alimwi muleelede kubika caabilo camunzi, cili abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zyosanwe abulamfu bwatukokola tuli makumi obile amusanu, kumbali lyacaabilo cisalala. Ciyooba caluzubo loonse lwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
