        },
        {
          "text": "Alakwe silutwe uyoovuba nyika kumabazu oonse obile aacaabilo cisalala acaabilo camunzi, kunembo lyacaabilo cisalala akunembo lyacaabilo camunzi, koonse koonse kujwe akumbo. Iyooba abulamfu mbubonya mbuli cimwi cazyaabilo zyamikowa, kuzwa kumugaano wakujwe kusikila kumugaano wakumbo, ",
          "type": "text",
