        },
        {
          "text": "Nyika eyo iyooba caabilo cakwe, acivube. Basilutwe bangu tabakooyoopenzya limbi bantu bangu, pe, bayooabila luzubo lwa-Israyeli nyika mumisyobo yabo.",
