        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Amuleke, nobasilutwe baIsrayeli! Amuleke kusaala akupenzya bantu! Amubambe imbeta cakululama! Amuleke kunyanzya bantu bangu, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova.",
