          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cisuwo cakweelesya anongo yakweelesya zileelede kweelana; nongo ileelede kujata cipanzi cakumi cahomeri, acalo cisuwo cileelede kujata cipanzi cakumi cahomeri. Homeri nceceelesyo ceelede, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
