          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AmweeIwe uuelede wamafuta ngooyu: cipanzi cakumi canongo cigwisigwa mukori limwi alimwi (Kori nkokuti nongo zili ikumi, nkokwaamba lileelene ahomeri). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
